  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contract is to support Kenyan authorities in improving the governance and technical skills in the transport sector to develop a more efficient and safe transport system for increased productivity and reduced negative impacts on environment and the climate.</narrative>
